can you please try this:

``` php
$start = microtime(true);
$articles = $this->Articles->find()->first();
$diff = microtime(true) - $start;
var_dump($diff);
```

when working on Crud v4 for Cake 3 it's been very very fast - not slower than cake 2 by any non-scientific measurements

also keep in mind that your variable is plural `$articles` and calling `->first()` will only select one record. did you modify your example code for us or is this simply a grammar error?
